{"id":"wb-8-581","name":"英国驻温州领事馆旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"英国驻温州领事馆","text":"英国驻温州领事馆是英国政府驻中国浙江温州的正式外交机构，于1877年设立，1900年裁撤，1924年正式撤销，期间共有12任领事。领事馆旧址位于温州江心屿，是全国重点文物保护单位，现辟为温州近代开埠史馆。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8B%B1%E5%9B%BD%E9%A9%BB%E6%B8%A9%E5%B7%9E%E9%A2%86%E4%BA%8B%E9%A6%86","revisionId":91635742,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91635742","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核名称、所在地与对应遗址；原名录行政地址及参考点位不作为唯一判断依据","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8915796aab7eea51654e193a.jpg","title":"Jiangxinyu_2016.3.13-1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jiangxinyu_2016.3.13-1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8f/Jiangxinyu_2016.3.13-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Gmbsfd","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​浙江省温州市江心屿英国领事馆","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"英国驻温州领事馆"}}